import ../../../../config.js
import template.mcbt
# The tune itself is the horn's instrument component, one instrument per song and part under instrument/.
# The use time and range live on the instruments. This file swaps the instrument to match the player's stance
# and draws the note particles.

# Called every tick while the player is using a copper goat horn. Draws a note about every half second.
function on_using_item {
    execute if predicate foxcraft_dungeon_loot:random_chance/10_percent at @s anchored eyes run particle minecraft:note ^ ^0.5 ^

    advancement revoke @s only foxcraft_dungeon_loot:item/copper_goat_horn/on_using_item
}

function on_load {
    scoreboard objectives add satyrn.fdl.copperGoatHorn.currentPitch dummy

    execute store success score #test <%config.internalScoreboard%> run scoreboard players get copperGoatHorn.minHarmonyPitch <%config.internalScoreboard%>
    execute if score #test <%config.internalScoreboard%> matches 0 run scoreboard players set copperGoatHorn.minHarmonyPitch <%config.internalScoreboard%> 30
}

function on_tick {
    execute as @a if items entity @s weapon.mainhand minecraft:goat_horn[minecraft:custom_data~{CopperGoatHorn:1b}] run function foxcraft_dungeon_loot:item/special/copper_horn/main/swap_mainhand
    execute as @a if items entity @s weapon.offhand minecraft:goat_horn[minecraft:custom_data~{CopperGoatHorn:1b}] run function foxcraft_dungeon_loot:item/special/copper_horn/main/swap_offhand
}

# Swaps the instrument of the horn in the main hand.
function swap_mainhand {
    execute store result score @s satyrn.fdl.copperGoatHorn.currentPitch run data get entity @s Rotation[1] -1
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand great_sky_falling
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand old_hymn_resting
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand pure_water_desire
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand mumble_fire_memory
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand dry_urge_anger
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand clear_temper_journey
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand fresh_nest_thought
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand secret_lake_tear
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand fearless_river_gift
    horn_swap weapon.mainhand sweet_moon_love
}

# Swaps the instrument of the horn in the off hand.
function swap_offhand {
    execute store result score @s satyrn.fdl.copperGoatHorn.currentPitch run data get entity @s Rotation[1] -1
    horn_swap weapon.offhand great_sky_falling
    horn_swap weapon.offhand old_hymn_resting
    horn_swap weapon.offhand pure_water_desire
    horn_swap weapon.offhand mumble_fire_memory
    horn_swap weapon.offhand dry_urge_anger
    horn_swap weapon.offhand clear_temper_journey
    horn_swap weapon.offhand fresh_nest_thought
    horn_swap weapon.offhand secret_lake_tear
    horn_swap weapon.offhand fearless_river_gift
    horn_swap weapon.offhand sweet_moon_love
}

function on_uninstall {
    scoreboard objectives remove satyrn.fdl.copperGoatHorn.currentPitch

    scoreboard players reset copperGoatHorn.minHarmonyPitch <%config.internalScoreboard%>
}

# Gives the target the clear temper journey.
function give_clear_temper_journey {
    loot give @s loot foxcraft_dungeon_loot:item/special/copper_horn/clear_temper_journey
}

# Gives the target the dry urge anger.
function give_dry_urge_anger {
    loot give @s loot foxcraft_dungeon_loot:item/special/copper_horn/dry_urge_anger
}

